            <ArticleTitle>Monitoring of Au(iii) species in plants using a selective fluorescent probe.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1039/c7cc08333e</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A colorimetric and ratiometric probe with a push-pull chromophore dicyanoisophorone system, AuP, has been developed for the detection of Au(iii) species with highly sensitive and selective response to real-water samples and living tissues of Arabidopsis thaliana.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
